    "description": "<p>Ghoul Fever (disease). Basic Fortitude; each stage 1 day. Stage 1 no effect; Stage 2 2d8 essence (all healing halves); Stage 4 2d8 essence (all healing fails); Stage 6 death, returning as a ghoul the following night.</p>\n<p>Statistics from Fiends & Fables (Graham, 7 Oct 2026). Spread by Ghoul Fever (Unliving Ghoul) at the ghoul's level, so the save is that level's DC rather than the printed DC 18. Stages 3 and 5 are not printed and carry the stage before them. The healing penalties are the table's (the card says so).</p>",
